{
 "_about": "Music-app themes for tunebox (copied from the replica-entrepreneur default and extended). Used with: python3 .claude/skills/replica-entrepreneur/reviews.py replica/reviews.csv --themes replica/themes-music.json --out replica/feedback.md",
